{"E:\\videos\\olc02\\wt\\vlog\\olc06\\voz\\b001_t3.wav": {"text": "Pea soup is the simplest pot there is, but it has three or four little rules, and if nobody ever told you those rules, it fights you every time. So tonight I'm going to show you exactly how I made the Thursday soup, step by step, every rule, and I went to the store this week and priced it. If you've got the bone left over from a ham, and I'll show you why you should always keep it, A pot that feeds eight comes to about $2.50. That's about 30 cents a bowl today. And even if you have to buy a smoked ham hock, it's still well under a dollar a bowl. And the cornbread that goes beside it, I'll show you that too, because a pea soup without cornbread is only half a supper. You know me, I'm old. I cooked in the logging camps up in northern Minnesota, in the log cook shack, with a wood range and a soup pot that held four gallons.", "words": [{"w": " Pea", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.28}, {"w": " soup", "s": 0.28, "e": 0.44}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.44, "e": 0.72}, {"w": " the", "s": 0.72, "e": 0.9}, {"w": " simplest", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.38}, {"w": " pot", "s": 1.38, "e": 1.7}, {"w": " there", "s": 1.7, "e": 1.94}, {"w": " is,", "s": 1.94, "e": 2.68}, {"w": " but", "s": 2.68, "e": 2.78}, {"w": " it", "s": 2.78, "e": 2.94}, {"w": " has", "s": 2.94, "e": 3.22}, {"w": " three", "s": 3.22, "e": 3.46}, {"w": " or", "s": 3.46, "e": 3.66}, {"w": " four", "s": 3.66, "e": 3.9}, {"w": " little", "s": 3.9, "e": 4.2}, {"w": " rules,", "s": 4.2, "e": 5.04}, {"w": " and", "s": 5.02, "e": 5.16}, {"w": " if", "s": 5.16, "e": 5.3}, {"w": " nobody", "s": 5.3, "e": 5.78}, {"w": " ever", "s": 5.78, "e": 6.14}, {"w": " told", "s": 6.14, "e": 6.46}, {"w": " you", "s": 6.46, "e": 6.62}, {"w": " those", "s": 6.62, "e": 6.88}, {"w": " rules,", "s": 6.88, "e": 7.72}, {"w": " it", "s": 7.72, "e": 7.86}, {"w": " fights", "s": 7.86, "e": 8.16}, {"w": " you", "s": 8.16, "e": 8.36}, {"w": " every", "s": 8.36, "e": 8.64}, {"w": " time.", "s": 8.64, "e": 9.54